<newsitem itemid="192449" id="root" date="1996-11-15" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on HK property basket.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on HK property basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG said on Friday it has issued 38 million American-style call warrants on a basket of property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Great Eagle Holdings Ltd	   0.3 shares</p>
<p> Hysan Development Ltd		0.7 shares</p>
<p> Hang Lung Development Co Ltd     1.1 shares</p>
<p> Amoy Properties Ltd		  1.7 shares</p>
<p> Swire Pacific Ltd A		  0.3 shares</p>
<p> Wharf (Holdings) Ltd		 0.5 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.  </p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$90.968    PREMIUM	   8.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.869     GEARING	   5.4X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.NOV.97    MIN EXER LOT    10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    GOVERNING LAW   HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$101.075</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR CASH AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>OPTION -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
